@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+## Context
+
+`price()` in `src/index.ts` is the single place computing a total; both `quote` and `book` use it, so they cannot diverge.
+
+## Goals / Non-Goals
+
+**Goals:** 10% off from 3 days, in quotes and bookings, integer cents.
+**Non-Goals:** other discount tiers, configurable rates, per-item rules.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Apply the discount inside `price()` so quote and booking stay identical.
+- Compute with integers: `Math.round(full * 9 / 10)`, which rounds halves up (totals are non-negative). Avoids float errors from `* 0.9`.
+- Name the threshold (3 days) and rate as constants.
+
+## Risks / Trade-offs
+
+- Rounding to the nearest cent is an assumption; the request did not say how to round.
