@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer. Rentals of 3 days or more should cost less than the full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental of 3 or more days costs 10% less than its full price (daily price times days).
+- The reduced total is what `quote` returns and what `book` records and returns, so both stay equal.
+- The discounted total is rounded to the nearest euro cent (half up), as totals are integer cents.
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+(none)
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: the Quote requirement now applies a 10% discount from 3 days; Booking follows through its existing "same total as quote" rule.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: the `price` function.
+- `test/rental.test.ts`: new tests for the discount.
+- No API shape change.
